{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "latam", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1704067200, "end_date": 1706745599, "month_true_total": 11, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:56:19 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "156841665", "author": {"steamid": "76561199072969009", "personaname": "PEQUENSIO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199072969009/", "num_games_owned": 325, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 2750, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1770, "last_played": 1737414616, "avatar": "4d5949907ffc509735e87e056a4b5accebce5201"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Más vivo que el payday 3", "timestamp_created": 1706246566, "timestamp_updated": 1706246566, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.380952417850494385", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156765093", "author": {"steamid": "76561199028041590", "personaname": "LALOLXV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199028041590/", "num_games_owned": 86, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 196, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 196, "last_played": 1753346314, "avatar": "dff9ccd2a9bd8522c5ee52aaceac3160243b5d14"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Siendo sincero, pense que seria algo mucho mejor que Left 4 dead, pero la realidad es que no...\nSi buscan algo divertido, algo bien balanceado con sus dinamicas en la parte de shooter de zombies recomiendo mas Left 4 dead 2, no voy a mentir me gusto la calidad HD del juego, se ve increible, pero las misiones son repetitivas a veces confusas y las armas ps no se sienten equilibradas, los zombies especiales, no son tan dificiles de matar, no te dan esa sensacion de peligro, como en left 4 dead...\nQuieren algo complejo y tactico y de Calidad Visual Back 4 Blood\nQuieren algo divertido, entretenido, con mods, y muchos modos de juego, intrigante, desafiante, etc....\nLEFT 4 DEAD 2", "timestamp_created": 1706172214, "timestamp_updated": 1706172214, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494699656963348389", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156512962", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078055285", "personaname": "Yugi ♥", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/memolex11/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1004, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 451, "last_played": 1743357129, "avatar": "ef2859edc6b6bf7c16c0fe2734de835ea69a7117"}, "language": "latam", "review": "estuvo genial, algo nuevo, te cambia la idea del left4dead y pasa otro plano. hay mejoras de armas, ropa y demas. Te quiere hacer jugar mas y mas para poder conseguir las cartas", "timestamp_created": 1705885286, "timestamp_updated": 1705885286, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156485209", "author": {"steamid": "76561198311228084", "personaname": "Caballero66", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198311228084/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3168, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2854, "last_played": 1753322652, "avatar": "9b75cb8641bec11676f66f3d8eb4995ddec08908"}, "language": "latam", "review": "muy buen juego aunque las armas se deberian editar de manera mas personalizadas en lo que es cañon mira cargador y culata pero es muy buen juego", "timestamp_created": 1705858733, "timestamp_updated": 1705858733, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156210809", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000301069", "personaname": "soloHATE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/byngb/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 240, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 240, "last_played": 1705550123, "avatar": "0184b1f80783bbe4cddcf78dc0418200ea7d7299"}, "language": "latam", "review": "BUEN JUEGO", "timestamp_created": 1705550128, "timestamp_updated": 1705550128, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156018793", "author": {"steamid": "76561198356729606", "personaname": "TheBroul", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thebroul/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 338, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 338, "last_played": 1705293410, "avatar": "a60d2b59943ba3280c469754ccd7349c3e55367e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego no vale la pena en ningún apartado, el gameplay no es divertido, intentaron innovar con las cartas de corrupción pero la verdad no es nada entretenido, el juego no se esfuerza en darte una explicación medianamente entendible y el juego no me incita a querer aprender a usar ese sistema de juego, el gameplay en si no es divertido ni innovador comparándolo con su inspiración espiritual, los personajes no son entrañables, no hay un lore que te enganche o te motive a indagar mas en los personajes, el precio sin oferta es ridículo ya que no lo vale ni tantito, $1200 por 1 CAMPAÑA, ni siquiera es el juego completo, si quieres la experiencia completa tienes que pagar $200 mas por cada expansión, lo único divertido que encontré jugando con un amigo fue el mini modo versus en el lobby de espera, fuera de eso el juego no ofrece nada mas, si quieren jugar algo similar quédense siempre con Left 4 Dead.", "timestamp_created": 1705300059, "timestamp_updated": 1705300059, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155602167", "author": {"steamid": "76561199435278877", "personaname": "B4B", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199435278877/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 137903, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 492, "playtime_at_review": 118393, "last_played": 1788048105, "avatar": "e4d9d5407b61a1f8b809ebff824c65c3c1499310"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Asombrosa rejugabilidad.", "timestamp_created": 1704775280, "timestamp_updated": 1766615926, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502074718475341797", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155358141", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084497688", "personaname": "Any", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/anyrhing/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 673, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 240, "last_played": 1761255451, "avatar": "b2a734431d40a6c110b7c09b1b3b65ad5819c79f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Amazing visuals! not very fun as left 4 dead but still good", "timestamp_created": 1704511357, "timestamp_updated": 1704511357, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155269742", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083150069", "personaname": "RATASA™ El Auténtico", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ratasaxDYOLO/", "num_games_owned": 319, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2108, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1026, "last_played": 1750566124, "avatar": "1f184e0fa7bf13321aae4377c78d528d38d60fa2"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Excelente para jugar con amigos, pasas buenos ratos, sería genial la opción de expulsar jugadores molestos como en el L4D2, aprovechenlo más en oferta con su DLC.", "timestamp_created": 1704414335, "timestamp_updated": 1704414335, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50265955924987793", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155195935", "author": {"steamid": "76561199488261205", "personaname": "kevin p", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199488261205/", "num_games_owned": 31, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2792, "last_played": 1777515902, "avatar": "cecdd1d6cd47da45e063ceb66d760bed50711ccb"}, "language": "latam", "review": "este juego intento ser mucho mas de lo que ofrecia sin embargo me parece que logro ser un gran juego si te olvidas que tiene algo que ver con left 4 dead, lo recomiendo por sus mecanicas complejas y desafiantes a la hora de jugar junto con personajes que no son muy recordables aunque te puedes llegar a identificar y tomar a tu favorito ya sea por su aspecto o ventajas las expanciones que ha recibido son pasables con mas campaña y una nueva mecanica\nopino que le a ayudado que ultimamente tenga descuentos muy buenos y accesibles \neste juego me encanto al igual que otros del genero como left 4 dead\n", "timestamp_created": 1704336808, "timestamp_updated": 1704336808, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155092702", "author": {"steamid": "76561199058260475", "personaname": "SaintWeiler", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199058260475/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 162, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 86, "last_played": 1704506067, "avatar": "6f02d1444474bccce6be55c36ba3e4fe81ce3ff6"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Por lo poco que jugué, se siente fluido y frenético, no esta mal, lo malo es que ya no cuenta con soporte de parte de su desarrolladora, eso es lo más grave que puedo ver, ya que no es un mal juego, simplemente le falta cariño, tengo esperanzas en que microsoft compre la empresa, para poder seguir dando soporte como pasaron con otros juegos (fallout 76) por más de que sigue siendo un juego que en lo personal no disfruto, tiene una comunidad fiel a su juego. Eso es lo que faltaría que tenga este juego para que vea más futuro, pero en general es divertido y si esta en oferta, no dudes en comprarlo.", "timestamp_created": 1704231139, "timestamp_updated": 1704231139, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.552325606346130371", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}